Keep a shared parts as an empty list of text.
Set parts to split "172.16.254.1" by ".".
Keep a shared parts6 as an empty list of text.
Set parts6 to split "172.16.254.1" by ":".
Keep a shared bad as 0.
Keep a shared bad6 as 0.
To check from spot (a whole number) with cap (a whole number).
If spot is at least cap, return.
If bad is 1, return.
The part is item spot of parts.
The size is the length of part.
If size is less than 1, set bad to 1.
If size is more than 3, set bad to 1.
If size is more than 1 and character 0 of part is "0", set bad to 1.
The total is 0.
For every index from 0 to size minus 1.
The symbol is character index of part.
The isnum is 0.
The value is the digit value of symbol.
If symbol is between "0" and "9", set isnum to 1.
If isnum is 0, set bad to 1.
If isnum is 1, set total to total times 10 plus value.
If total is more than 255, set bad to 1.
If index is size minus 1, check from spot plus 1 with cap.

To verify from spot (a whole number) with cap (a whole number).
If spot is at least cap, return.
If bad6 is 1, return.
The part is item spot of parts6.
The size is the length of part.
If size is less than 1, set bad6 to 1.
If size is more than 4, set bad6 to 1.
For every index from 0 to size minus 1.
The symbol is character index of part.
The ishex is 0.
If symbol is between "0" and "9", set ishex to 1.
If symbol is between "a" and "f", set ishex to 1.
If symbol is between "A" and "F", set ishex to 1.
If ishex is 0, set bad6 to 1.
If index is size minus 1, verify from spot plus 1 with cap.

The last is the last position of parts.
The count is last plus 1.
The last6 is the last position of parts6.
The count6 is last6 plus 1.
Check from 0 with count.
Verify from 0 with count6.
The is4 is 0.
If count is 4 and bad is 0, set is4 to 1.
If is4 is 1, show "IPv4".
If is4 is 0 and count6 is 8 and bad6 is 0, show "IPv6".
If is4 is 0 and count6 is not 8, show "Neither".
If is4 is 0 and count6 is 8 and bad6 is 1, show "Neither".
